  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "This is my room. It is big. I have many toys. Look at my helicopter. It is white. Is it small? No, it is big!",
      "I have a lorry. It is small. It is yellow. Is it a good lorry? Yes, it is! My monster is green. It is very big. Is it scary? Yes, it is scary!",
      "I have a crocodile. Is it scary? No, it is a toy. I have a toy dog too. It is brown and small. I like my big room. Do you like it?"
    ],
    "summary": "Ben shows his toys in his room. He says the color and the size of his helicopter, lorry, monster, crocodile, and dog.",
